From 943255ac812281416d883be87451ce55c8d39773 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Arnaud Pouliquen <arnaud.pouliquen@foss.st.com>
Date: Tue, 21 Jul 2026 17:06:30 +0200
Subject: [PATCH] arm64: dts: st: stm32mp2: m33_rproc: add post-init-providers
 for ret_pd
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

m33_rproc references the ret_pd power domain in the device tree.

Because the parent mlahb bus (ahb) driver binds before m33_rproc is
registered, the fw_devlink “dangling consumer pickup” mechanism
re-attributes m33_rproc’s fwnode links to ahb@2.

When m33_rproc is registered, a link is created between it and the power
domain, but the link to ahb is not purged, causing this warning:

genpd_provider power-domain-retention: sync_state() pending due to ahb@2

Add post-init-providers property to m33_rproc to avoid enforcing the
sync_state dependency for this link. The link is created later during
m33_rproc probing.

Change-Id: I9f6c18f302df7a5733170ea89964f70dd1b8f355
Signed-off-by: Arnaud Pouliquen <arnaud.pouliquen@foss.st.com>
Reviewed-on: https://gerrit.st.com/c/mpu/oe/st/linux-stm32/+/590824
ACI: CITOOLS <MDG-smet-aci-reviews@list.st.com>
Reviewed-by: Arnaud POULIQUEN <arnaud.pouliquen@st.com>
Tested-by: Arnaud POULIQUEN <arnaud.pouliquen@st.com>
ACI: CIBUILD <MDG-smet-aci-builds@list.st.com>
Domain-Review: Patrick DELAUNAY <patrick.delaunay@foss.st.com>
Reviewed-by: Olivier MOYSAN <olivier.moysan@foss.st.com>
---
 arch/arm64/boot/dts/st/stm32mp211.dtsi | 1 +
 arch/arm64/boot/dts/st/stm32mp231.dtsi | 2 +-
 arch/arm64/boot/dts/st/stm32mp251.dtsi | 1 +
 3 files changed, 3 insertions(+), 1 deletion(-)

--- a/arch/arm64/boot/dts/st/stm32mp211.dtsi
+++ b/arch/arm64/boot/dts/st/stm32mp211.dtsi
@@ -2360,6 +2360,7 @@
 			nvmem-cell-names = "rsc-tbl-addr", "rsc-tbl-size";
 			power-domains = <&cluster_pd>, <&ret_pd>;
 			power-domain-names = "default", "sleep";
+			post-init-providers = <&cluster_pd>, <&ret_pd>;
 			status = "disabled";
 		};
 	};
--- a/arch/arm64/boot/dts/st/stm32mp231.dtsi
+++ b/arch/arm64/boot/dts/st/stm32mp231.dtsi
@@ -2701,7 +2701,7 @@
 			nvmem-cell-names = "rsc-tbl-addr", "rsc-tbl-size";
 			power-domains = <&cluster_pd>, <&ret_pd>;
 			power-domain-names = "default", "sleep";
-
+			post-init-providers = <&cluster_pd>, <&ret_pd>;
 			status = "disabled";
 		};
 	};
--- a/arch/arm64/boot/dts/st/stm32mp251.dtsi
+++ b/arch/arm64/boot/dts/st/stm32mp251.dtsi
@@ -3006,6 +3006,7 @@
 			nvmem-cell-names = "rsc-tbl-addr", "rsc-tbl-size";
 			power-domains = <&cluster_pd>, <&ret_pd>;
 			power-domain-names = "default", "sleep";
+			post-init-providers = <&cluster_pd>, <&ret_pd>;
 			status = "disabled";
 		};
 	};
